@startuml
title Prakriti Ayursensora — how a session's data reaches the team
hide stereotype

skinparam backgroundColor #F7F6F3
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam defaultFontColor #243038
skinparam titleFontSize 18
skinparam titleFontColor #243038
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #5C6B73
  ArrowFontColor #3D4A52
  ArrowFontSize 12
  LifeLineBorderColor #C9D1D6
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F7F6F3
  ParticipantFontColor #243038
  ParticipantFontSize 12
  GroupBorderColor #D5DBE0
  GroupBackgroundColor #FBFBF9
  GroupHeaderFontColor #243038
  GroupFontSize 13
  BoxBorderColor #E4E0D8
  BoxFontColor #243038
  DividerBackgroundColor #EFEAE2
  DividerFontColor #243038
}

skinparam participant<<person>> {
  BackgroundColor #E7F6F8
  BorderColor #1C7C8C
}
skinparam participant<<clinician>> {
  BackgroundColor #F1EAF8
  BorderColor #6A4C9A
}
skinparam participant<<api>> {
  BackgroundColor #E4EEF8
  BorderColor #2C5F8A
}
skinparam participant<<data>> {
  BackgroundColor #EEF2F5
  BorderColor #3E5A70
}
skinparam participant<<display>> {
  BackgroundColor #F1EAF8
  BorderColor #6A4C9A
}
skinparam participant<<music>> {
  BackgroundColor #FBF1E4
  BorderColor #B86A28
}
skinparam participant<<aroma>> {
  BackgroundColor #E5F4EC
  BorderColor #2F7D57
}
skinparam participant<<team>> {
  BackgroundColor #F8F1D8
  BorderColor #8A6A1F
}

actor "Staff" as Staff <<person>>
actor "Clinician" as Clinician <<clinician>>
participant "FastAPI\nweb app" as API <<api>>
database "SQLite\non the Pi" as DB <<data>>
participant "Orchestrator" as Orch <<api>>
participant "Display\nmpv" as Display <<display>>
participant "Music\nmpv" as Music <<music>>
participant "ESP32\naroma" as ESP <<aroma>>
actor "Research\nteam" as Team <<team>>

== Enrol ==
Staff -> API : Create participant code\nand record consent
API -> DB : Save code and consent\nNo name is stored
Staff -> API : Submit the questionnaire
API -> DB : Save each answer
API -> DB : Save provisional scores\nVata, Pitta, Kapha

== Confirm ==
Clinician -> API : Review the scores\nand confirm the label
API -> DB : Save confirmed profile,\nblend weights, rule version

== Run one session ==
Staff -> API : Start
API -> Orch : Confirmed profile\n+ current-state check
Orch -> DB : Store the session plan
par Picture, sound, and mist follow the same plan
  Orch -> Display : Scene pool and time share
  Display --> Orch : Scene started
  Orch -> Music : Raga pool, volume cap
  Music --> Orch : Track started
  Orch -> ESP : Mist pulses\nUSB serial JSON
  ESP --> Orch : Ack, temperature,\nhumidity, faults
end
Orch -> DB : Write events and readings
Staff -> API : Pause or stop
API -> Orch : Stop
Orch -> ESP : Mist off
Orch -> Display : Fade picture
Orch -> Music : Fade sound
Orch -> DB : Close the session

== What the team receives ==
Team -> API : Export study pack
API -> DB : Read codes, scores,\nsessions, events, readings
API --> Team : Zip on the laptop\nparticipants, results,\nsessions, events, env, outcomes

note over DB, Team
  PSS, HADS, and PSQI are typed in by the clinical team.
  They are stored for the study. They do not drive the hardware.
  The hospital keeps the list that matches a code to a person.
  That list is not inside the zip.
end note

footer Live view is the phone dashboard. The lasting copy is the zip exported from the Pi.
@enduml
